data: {"id": "59d30c4c3681492b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1284", "run_id": "59d30c4c3681492b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n**1. Pod 生命周期与状态（Kubernetes + Metrics）**\n- Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 当前 `phase: Pending`，`containerStatus.reason: ContainerCreating`（kubectl describe 原文）。\n- Metrics 验证：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{..., reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1`，`kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"} = 1`，`phase=\"Running\"=0`；`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total = 0`。\n- 结论：Pod 仍处于异常等待状态，未恢复。\n\n**2. ContainerCreating 的直接原因（kubectl describe + Topology）**\n- describe 关键事实：`Failed to create pod ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788783750894, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "59d30c4c3681492b-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "59d30c4c3681492b", "seq": 1285, "ts_ms": 1788783761232, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 43.914, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/59d30c4c3681492b-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "5ab0ae6f053b1756cc7a5a3188222141827dbe5aeaac8fc9e8911c18d40849e6", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "f32bab72c81a2c0fa249f44b1e0271c622c8849c659b3525f24e600ae172946e"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "59d30c4c3681492b-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "59d30c4c3681492b", "seq": 1286, "ts_ms": 1788783761233, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "59d30c4c3681492b-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "59d30c4c3681492b", "seq": 1287, "ts_ms": 1788783770639, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.406, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1713, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx stuck in ContainerCreating / Pending |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ContainerCreating` | 证实 Pod 处于无法进入就绪的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `NoNetworkFound`: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` | 暴露核心缺失资源，持续报错频率达 46 次，直接说明 CNI 依赖不存在 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `failed to setup network for sandbox... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed` | 描述底层失败机制，Multus 插件因查找失败导致容器沙箱无法创建 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=ContainerCreating): `1` | 确认 Pod 持续处于等待阶段，无状态切换 |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | `not_applicable` | 因 Pod 卡在启动前，无物理日志产出，印证故障处于调度与网络层 |\n| 6 | Tracing | deepflow, tempo | `not_applicable` | `pod_ip is empty`，无网络通信记录，排除业务层问题 |\n\n**证据综述：**\n多源事实高度一致。Kubernetes 事件 (E2, E3) 给出了明确的失败链条（找不到定义 → Multus 失败 → 沙箱创建失败），Pod 状态 (E1) 和指标 (E4) 验证了该现象的持续性。由于无法获取应用日志与追踪，故障隔离在基础设施配置层，即 Pod 引用的网络配置项缺失。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 注解引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件因找不到定义而加载失败 → kubelet 无法创建容器沙箱 (CNI 失败) → Pod 卡死在 ContainerCreating / Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **网络配置依赖缺失**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 被配置请求加入名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络（证据 #2, #3），但 K8s 集群中该 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源不存在。这一配置错误导致 Multus CNI 插件在尝试配置网络时直接失败，进而阻断了容器沙箱的创建。\n\n**未知信息：**\n无法确认 `unavailable-network` 是预期存在的资源被遗漏，还是 Pod 注解本身存在拼写错误/配置失误。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx stuck in ContainerCreating / Pending |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ContainerCreating` | 证实 Pod 处于无法进入就绪的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `NoNetworkFound`: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` | 暴露核心缺失资源，持续报错频率达 46 次，直接说明 CNI 依赖不存在 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `failed to setup network for sandbox... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed` | 描述底层失败机制，Multus 插件因查找失败导致容器沙箱无法创建 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=ContainerCreating): `1` | 确认 Pod 持续处于等待阶段，无状态切换 |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | `not_applicable` | 因 Pod 卡在启动前，无物理日志产出，印证故障处于调度与网络层 |\n| 6 | Tracing | deepflow, tempo | `not_applicable` | `pod_ip is empty`，无网络通信记录，排除业务层问题 |\n\n**证据综述：**\n多源事实高度一致。Kubernetes 事件 (E2, E3) 给出了明确的失败链条（找不到定义 → Multus 失败 → 沙箱创建失败），Pod 状态 (E1) 和指标 (E4) 验证了该现象的持续性。由于无法获取应用日志与追踪，故障隔离在基础设施配置层，即 Pod 引用的网络配置项缺失。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 注解引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件因找不到定义而加载失败 → kubelet 无法创建容器沙箱 (CNI 失败) → Pod 卡死在 ContainerCreating / Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **网络配置依赖缺失**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 被配置请求加入名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络（证据 #2, #3），但 K8s 集群中该 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源不存在。这一配置错误导致 Multus CNI 插件在尝试配置网络时直接失败，进而阻断了容器沙箱的创建。\n\n**未知信息：**\n无法确认 `unavailable-network` 是预期存在的资源被遗漏，还是 Pod 注解本身存在拼写错误/配置失误。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

